// KATA k2 — compose two histories.
//
// Requirement (spec.md, "Merge policy"):
//   An agent may merge PR X only if BOTH
//     (a) a human approved a code review of X (RequestApproval, kind = "review")
//         within the last 24 hours, and
//     (b) the tests passed on X with no push to X since (use the request,
//         as you learned in k1).
//
// Hints: a temporal block holds ONE condition, and the only connective is &&.
// Parenthesize a `since` when it is a conjunct.

@id("allow_other_tools")
permit (principal, action in Drupe::Action::"CallTool", resource)
unless { action == Drupe::Action::"MergePullRequest" };

// TODO: replace `when { false }` with the real rule.
@id("merge_rule")
permit (principal, action == Drupe::Action::"MergePullRequest", resource)
when { false };
